
 Farmer-User Interaction Platform - Detailed Overview

 1. Project Overview
The Farmer-User Interaction Platform is a full-stack web application that enables farmers to showcase their products, interact with users, manage cultivated land details, and facilitate product sales through an integrated online shop. It also includes a real-time chat system and secure payment processing.

---

 2. Backend - Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, Mongoose
 2.1. Tech Stack
- Express.js (Backend framework)
- MongoDB + Mongoose (Database and schema management)
- Socket.IO (Real-time chat)
- JWT (JSON Web Token) (Authentication)
- Bcrypt (Password hashing)
- Nodemailer (Email notifications)
- Razorpay (Payment gateway)

---

 2.2. Database Schemas (Mongoose)
1. User Schema  
   - Stores user details (username, email, password, profile image, etc.)
   - Uses `bcrypt` to hash passwords before saving

2. Farmer Schema  
   - Contains farmer details such as name, contact information, profile, and uploaded images

3. Product Schema  
   - Product information including ID, farmer contact, review, rating, price, category

4. Cultivated Land Schema  
   - Land details: latitude, longitude, area, pricing

5. Chat Schema  
   - Stores sender, recipient, message, and timestamp for chat history

---

 2.3. API Endpoints
- User APIs
  - Register (`POST /register`)
    - Checks if the username exists
    - Hashes password using `bcrypt`
  - Login (`POST /login`)
    - Compares password using `bcrypt.compare`
    - Generates a JWT token on successful login
  - Profile management

- Farmer APIs
  - Add farmer details (`POST /farmers`)
  - Fetch farmer list (`GET /farmers`)

- Product APIs
  - Add products (`POST /products`)
  - Get all products (`GET /products`)
  - Add review (`POST /products/review`)

- Cultivated Land APIs
  - Add land details (`POST /land`)
  - Fetch land details (`GET /land`)

- Chat API
  - Fetch chat history (`GET /chat/:userId`)
  - Send messages (`POST /chat`)

- Payment API (Razorpay)
  - Create order (`POST /create-order`)
  - Capture payment (`POST /capture-payment`)
  - Check payment status (`GET /is-order-complete`)

- Mailer API
  - Sends emails for order confirmation, password reset, and notifications.

---

 3. Real-time Chat Feature (Socket.IO)
 3.1. Backend (Express + Socket.IO)
- The server initializes Socket.IO and listens for connections.
- Stores connected users in an array.
- When a user sends a message (`socket.on("sendMessage")`):
  - Saves the message in the database (MongoDB).
  - Sends the message only to the intended recipient.
- Handles disconnect events (`socket.on("disconnect")`).

 3.2. Frontend (React + Socket.IO Client)
- Connects using `socket.io-client`.
- Sends messages using `socket.emit("sendMessage")`.
- Listens for messages using `socket.on("receiveMessage")` and updates UI.
- Displays active users in the chatroom UI.

---

 4. Frontend - React.js
 4.1. Tech Stack
- React.js (Frontend framework)
- Redux (State management)
- React Router (Navigation)
- Socket.IO Client (Chat)
- JWT Authentication (Secure access)
- Axios (API calls)

---

 4.2. Main Pages & Features
1. Home Page  
   - Displays all content of the website  
   - Only accessible after login verification (`jwt.verify` on the backend)

2. Register & Login Page  
   - Sends login credentials to backend API  
   - Stores JWT in headers for authentication  

3. Product Form  
   - Allows farmers to add new products  
   - API call to store product details in MongoDB  

4. Cultivated Land Form  
   - Enables users to add land details  
   - Includes latitude, longitude, land area, and pricing  

5. Online Shop
   - Displays all available products  
   - Filters products based on category  

6. Product Details Page
   - Shows product information, reviews, and comments  
   - Users can add products to the cart  

7. Cart Page
   - Displays all selected products  
   - Allows users to proceed to checkout  

8. Checkout Page (Payment Integration)
   - Uses Razorpay to process payments  
   - Sends confirmation email after successful payment  

9. Chatroom Page
   - Displays users list and "Start Chat" button  
   - Implements real-time messaging using `socket.emit` & `socket.on`  

---

 5. State Management using Redux
 Redux Stores
- User State
  - Stores login status & user info
- Cart State
  - Stores cart items and total price
- Chat State
  - Manages real-time message updates  

